From eb3870379886a3a6f19f27433340abd4ebd251b0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 01:59:58 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Verify the intended recommendation profile before deletion

Send the current UI erasure target with the DELETE request and compare it against the verified request identity before touching any profile. Reject missing target on cookie-authenticated account erasure, and use the same verified identity for the Engine signature and local cleanup.

Accept success in the player only when the acknowledged privacy mode matches. Cover stale guest and account sessions with signed Cookie and SQLite regressions, and browser retry behavior.

Base: shijianus/sonic rc/sonic-20261031 at bc6a47ffc2317bb78de4632dd0c3212cf6ce4b06.
